{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-15_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-15",
  "title": "冬逝",
  "storyCode": "6-17",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-15_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a0225ef7ae64b8382b4b7b0acda837ad0da30f3c71bad8da7152dd63166a45f0",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "碎了......吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "老爷子从某个巫师那里求得这样东西......说是能维持住我的性命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "连一场战斗都没撑过去，呵呵，终归，还是假货。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "也许就像我们父女一样......？和现在的，荒诞的整合运动......也一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "咳，咳......煌！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "寒流已经......消散了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我没事！阿米娅，快，去看看那只白兔子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "赢得漂亮，罗德岛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "我的兄弟姐妹们......我让他们白白死去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "我们什么都没做到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "text": "我的生命......一点价值都没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "他们是因为你的理念而追随你的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我的死......不值得任何人久留。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "去救你们还能救的人吧。赶快。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "快去。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "无论是阻止那些穿雨衣的，还是去追杀梅菲斯特，还是收容那些无处可去的感染者......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "去吧。去做有价值的事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "博士......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我留下。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你去吧。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "我知道了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "博士，请告诉霜星小姐那句话。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......拜托你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "真是只......天真的兔子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "很像啊。和当时的塔露拉，很像。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "在死前能看到这样的人，这样坚定地去实现理想的人......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "说好的责任呢？！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不是答应说要加入罗德岛的吗？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "凭你的头脑，应该也考虑到这点了吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "坏人也要有坏人该有的样子。我对自己应得的结局毫无怨言。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我伤害了你们，我和整合运动把目标对准了无辜的龙门人，一手促成了乌萨斯感染者的黑暗未来，这样的人根本没资格去罗德岛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我的兄弟姐妹......这些傻子，一定是想着让我活着吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "本以为哪怕这一次我死去了，这些傻子也能因此得到个允许他们活下去的地方。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "没有，并没有。他们死了。为了保护我这个本来就没多少时间的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我不甘心。我们的性命全都被人利用了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我不甘心......这最后一刻的生命，这一点不属于我，这是他们所有人用血去换来的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "这一点点生命.......我必须交给值得信任的人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "谢谢你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": ".......啊......即使活下来了，又有哪里可去呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我们本就没有其它地方可去。我们熟悉的从来就只有那片雪原而已。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "龙门并不是乌萨斯。渴望着拯救同胞和感染者，想要去找一处又温暖，又有粮食，还有住处的地方......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "不该是龙门。自一开始，就不该是龙门。龙门的市民也在苦苦寻求自己的生活。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我们唯一该回去的，就只有乌萨斯......我们的祖国......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "雪......静静的河水......摇曳的松林......碧绿的苔衣......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "这片大地，多么美好啊......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所以，你认为塔露拉是操纵了这一切的人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......如果我猜的没错......阴谋已经蓄势待发。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "就算博卓卡斯替老爷子能拖上一时，塔露拉既然敢这样谋划，就一定有对付他的办法。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "龙门没有出手的机会......而乌萨斯也会袖手旁观。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "但你们还在，感染者还有机会。哪怕只有一点点——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "——去毁掉现在的塔露拉。中止她的疯狂，不要让整合运动再吞噬更多感染者了。整合运动不需要塔露拉，任何一个塔露拉都不需要......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "或者......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......我的一点点私心。去拯救她。不。去帮助她。和我们那无数的感染者同胞一起......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "那个真正的......走在泥泞土地上的......塔露拉......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "霜星小姐？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "你......说。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我认为你父亲是真的爱你的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "就像你记得你的亲生父母为你而死。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你清楚地记着你父亲为你所做的一切。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我又怎么会不知道呢？只是，我要死在他之前了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "如果他从来没捡到我，那会有多好。那样，他就不会因我感到痛苦。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "他已经受了那么多的苦......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "正因为他受过很多苦，所以他才珍惜你。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "呵呵......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......博士。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我可以这么叫你吧？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "罗德岛的博士。在这片大地上，选择也许没有意义。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "即使这样，即使结果没有区别......我也想自己去选。我做出选择了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "用我自己的手......去擦拭我结出的果。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "霜星的手指摸索着你的面庞。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......你的手指，是暖的？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "奇怪。你的脸......很冰。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我的体温......没有那么低了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是。你的病征消失了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "很温暖，霜星。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......在死前......我终于又和人相碰了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "霜星，阿米娅和我都希望你加入罗德岛。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我真有这种资格？",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "仅仅是普通地死去，就没有时间再去改正错误。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......不给出答复是不礼貌的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "告诉阿米娅，Dr.{@nickname}......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "在这片大地上，仅凭一个人，是什么也做不到的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "但她绝对不是一个人。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "现在开始，我在你身边。我在你们身边。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我......愿意加入罗德岛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "谢谢你。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "不。是我......谢谢你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "你的眼神......和我一位旧识，很像。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我遇见过一个男孩，他说他的哥哥宁愿上绞架也不愿改变观点去迎合敌人的宽恕......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "所以他要走过雪原，他要踏遍乌萨斯.......所以他没有和我们一起走。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我以为那已经是我见过最理想化的人了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "只是，你和阿米娅让我觉得……也许理想也可以成为一种信念。",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "罗德岛就是为了共同的信念而战的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "原本整合运动......也是一样的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "真像啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "你的眼神，和那个孩子，真的很像。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "只不过，你没他那么坚定，但却比他......温柔太多了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "放手吧。兄弟姐妹们在等我。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......父亲......我真是个傻子。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "原谅我吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
